# The sun's screen ray over the grass (../README.md): the blades shade the ground at their roots and each other.
# The meadow east of the tavern at noon, in the morning and in the late afternoon, the hero in the grass, from three
# sides of the sun; a market shot where nothing may change. Two runs of the same shots, both with OPENGOTHIC_RT=1
# OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<the working content>:
#   without   OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_CONTACT=0
#   with      (the default)
# scripts/bench.sh reports/render-features/2026-11-16-grass-sun-contact/tools/grass-contact.bench <out>
# Sheets: tools/grass_contact_sheets.py <without> <with> <out dir>
# @timeout 900
